                                        "entry_id": "bdadbeaf-9958-3281-b710-9da3f6bcba42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of, or suitable for, being hugged."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39ad7fb0-82d3-4132-8704-0705747167dc",
                                                "sense_id": "97b894a5-87b1-3c96-99aa-0146afc90450",
                                                "text": "How high? Real high 'cause I'm just so fly / A young lovable, huggable type of guy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f389463e-6daa-400e-8934-fa4a718f1901",
                                                "sense_id": "97b894a5-87b1-3c96-99aa-0146afc90450",
                                                "text": "Claud was glad to oblige, since Gabbie is an extremely huggable girl."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a41dbc7-b330-4943-8c19-de4ca2805513",
                                                "sense_id": "97b894a5-87b1-3c96-99aa-0146afc90450",
                                                "text": "Moreover, this need often manifests itself in the young child's selection of a cuddly or huggable doll or stuffed animal, called a transitional object by child psychologists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d22457fe-f0a7-4705-b81e-0f0a788d8ee9",
                                                "sense_id": "97b894a5-87b1-3c96-99aa-0146afc90450",
                                                "text": "He was exactly how she remembered him. Where Tyrell was cuddly and huggable, Mohammad was hard and sinewy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
